and got:

No resources found in ingress-nginx namespace.

That means you still do not have an NGINX Ingress Controller installed.

Until you install an Ingress Controller (or another controller that watches Ingress resources), Kubernetes has nothing to process your Ingress object, so the ADDRESS column will remain empty.

Summary

