Service selector mismatch ❌
Change app: bankapp → app: bankapps.
This will populate the Service endpoints.
No Ingress Controller installed ❌
Install the NGINX Ingress Controller.
After it is running and its LoadBalancer service gets an AWS DNS name, the ADDRESS field in kubectl get ingress will be populated.

Fixing the Service selector is necessary for traffic to reach your application, but you will also need a running Ingress Controller before the Ingress itself can be accessed externally.


